#: tarot_strings.lua:274
msgid "About Tarot and Lenormand"
msgstr "Acerca del Tarot y Lenormand"

#: tarot_strings.lua:275
msgid ""
"Tarot is a deck of 78 cards, divided into Major Arcana (22) and Minor Arcana "
"(56), used for reflection and self-knowledge. The Lenormand deck has 36 "
"cards with direct symbolism for practical guidance.\n"
"\n"
"Credits for the free card images:\n"
"• Lenormand Cards by Yve Lepkowski (https://stolen-thyme.com/)\n"
"• Tarot Cards by Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett (https://luciellaes.itch.io/)"
msgstr ""
"El Tarot es una baraja de 78 cartas, dividida en Arcanos Mayores (22) y "
"Arcanos Menores (56), usada para la reflexión y el autoconocimiento. La "
"baraja Lenormand tiene 36 cartas con simbolismo directo para orientación "
"práctica.\n"
"\n"
"Créditos de las imágenes gratuitas de las cartas:\n"
"• Cartas Lenormand de Yve Lepkowski (https://stolen-thyme.com/)\n"
"• Cartas de Tarot de Luciella Elisabeth Scarlett (https://luciellaes.itch."
"io/)"

