#: tarot_cards.lua:9
msgid "The Fool"
msgstr "El Loco"

#: tarot_cards.lua:10
msgid "New beginning, spontaneity, faith, risk"
msgstr "Nuevo comienzo, espontaneidad, fe, riesgo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:11
msgid "Uranus"
msgstr "Urano"

#: tarot_cards.lua:12
msgid "Immediate, unpredictable"
msgstr "Inmediato, impredecible"

#: tarot_cards.lua:13
msgid ""
"New beginnings. Spontaneity. Take a leap of faith. Venture without fear, the "
"universe supports you."
msgstr ""
"Nuevos comienzos. espontaneidad. Da un salto de fe. Aventúrate sin miedo, el "
"universo te apoya."

#: tarot_cards.lua:14
msgid ""
"Recklessness. Lack of direction. Think before acting. Blind risk may bring "
"consequences."
msgstr ""
"imprudencia. Falta de dirección. Piensa antes de actuar. El riesgo ciego "
"puede traer consecuencias."

#: tarot_cards.lua:18
msgid "The Magician"
msgstr "El Mago"

#: tarot_cards.lua:19
msgid "Power, skill, manifestation, focus"
msgstr "poder, habilidad, manifestación, foco"

#: tarot_cards.lua:20
msgid "Mercury"
msgstr "Mercurio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:21
msgid "Fast, now is the time"
msgstr "Rápido, ahora es el momento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:22
msgid ""
"Personal power. Skill. You have everything you need. Manifest your desires "
"with confidence."
msgstr ""
"Poder personal. habilidad. Tienes todo lo que necesitas. Manifiesta tus "
"deseos con confianza."

#: tarot_cards.lua:23
msgid "Manipulation. Wasted talent. Deceit. Beware of illusions of power."
msgstr ""
"manipulación. Talento desperdiciado. engaño. Cuidado con las ilusiones de "
"poder."

#: tarot_cards.lua:27
msgid "The High Priestess"
msgstr "La Sacerdotisa"

#: tarot_cards.lua:28
msgid "Intuition, mystery, subconscious, wisdom"
msgstr "intuición, misterio, subconsciente, sabiduría"

#: tarot_cards.lua:29
msgid "Moon"
msgstr "Luna"

#: tarot_cards.lua:30
msgid "Lunar cycles, 28 days"
msgstr "Ciclos lunares, 28 días"

#: tarot_cards.lua:31
msgid ""
"Intuition. Mystery. Trust your inner voice. Hidden knowledge reveals itself "
"in silence."
msgstr ""
"intuición. misterio. Confía en tu voz interior. El conocimiento oculto se "
"revela en el silencio."

#: tarot_cards.lua:32
msgid ""
"Secrets revealed. Intuitive disconnection. Silence broken. Listen to your "
"inner voice again."
msgstr ""
"Secretos revelados. Desconexión intuitiva. Silencio roto. Escucha de nuevo "
"tu voz interior."

#: tarot_cards.lua:36
msgid "The Empress"
msgstr "La Emperatriz"

#: tarot_cards.lua:37
msgid "Abundance, fertility, nature, nurturing"
msgstr "abundancia, fertilidad, naturaleza, cuidado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:38
msgid "Venus"
msgstr "Venus"

#: tarot_cards.lua:39
msgid "9 months, spring"
msgstr "9 meses, primavera"

#: tarot_cards.lua:40
msgid "Abundance. Fertility. Nurture yourself. Nature flourishes around you."
msgstr "abundancia. fertilidad. Cuídate. La naturaleza florece a tu alrededor."

#: tarot_cards.lua:41
msgid ""
"Neglect. Creative block. Dependence. Return to tending your inner garden."
msgstr ""
"descuido. Bloqueo creativo. dependencia. Vuelve a cuidar tu jardín interior."

#: tarot_cards.lua:45
msgid "The Emperor"
msgstr "El Emperador"

#: tarot_cards.lua:46
msgid "Authority, structure, leadership, stability"
msgstr "autoridad, estructura, liderazgo, estabilidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:47
msgid "Aries"
msgstr "Aries"

#: tarot_cards.lua:48
msgid "1 year, soon"
msgstr "1 año, pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:49
msgid "Authority. Structure. Take control. Firm leadership brings stability."
msgstr ""
"autoridad. estructura. Toma el control. Un liderazgo firme trae estabilidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:50
msgid "Tyranny. Rigidity. Lack of discipline. Excess control suffocates."
msgstr "tiranía. rigidez. Falta de disciplina. El exceso de control asfixia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:54
msgid "The Hierophant"
msgstr "El Hierofante"

#: tarot_cards.lua:55
msgid "Tradition, wisdom, guidance, teaching"
msgstr "tradición, sabiduría, orientación, enseñanza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:56
msgid "Taurus"
msgstr "Tauro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:57
msgid "5 weeks, slow but steady"
msgstr "5 semanas, lento pero seguro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:58
msgid ""
"Tradition. Wisdom. Seek guidance. Masters appear when the student is ready."
msgstr ""
"tradición. sabiduría. Busca orientación. Los maestros aparecen cuando el "
"estudiante está listo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:59
msgid ""
"Rebellion. Dogma. Necessary questioning. Breaking with traditions can be "
"liberating."
msgstr ""
"rebeldía. dogma. Cuestionamiento necesario. Romper con las tradiciones puede "
"ser liberador."

#: tarot_cards.lua:63
msgid "The Lovers"
msgstr "Los Enamorados"

#: tarot_cards.lua:64
msgid "Love, choice, harmony, partnership"
msgstr "amor, elección, armonía, alianza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:65
msgid "Gemini"
msgstr "Géminis"

#: tarot_cards.lua:66
msgid "Imminent decision"
msgstr "Decisión inminente"

#: tarot_cards.lua:67
msgid "Love. Choice. Harmony in relationships. The heart knows the way."
msgstr ""
"amor. elección. Armonía en las relaciones. El corazón conoce el camino."

#: tarot_cards.lua:68
msgid ""
"Conflict. Imbalance. Difficult decision. Avoid impulsive choices in love."
msgstr ""
"conflicto. desequilibrio. Decisión difícil. Evita decisiones impulsivas en "
"el amor."

#: tarot_cards.lua:72
msgid "The Chariot"
msgstr "El Carro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:73
msgid "Victory, determination, control, progress"
msgstr "victoria, determinación, control, progreso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:74
msgid "Cancer"
msgstr "Cáncer"

#: tarot_cards.lua:75 tarot_cards.lua:288
msgid "7 weeks"
msgstr "7 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:76
msgid ""
"Victory. Determination. Move forward with confidence. Triumph awaits the "
"perseverant."
msgstr ""
"victoria. determinación. Avanza con confianza. El triunfo espera a quien "
"persevera."

#: tarot_cards.lua:77
msgid ""
"Lack of direction. Defeat. Loss of control. Reevaluate your route before "
"proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Falta de dirección. derrota. Pérdida de control. Reevalúa tu ruta antes de "
"continuar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:81
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "La Fuerza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:82
msgid "Courage, inner strength, compassion, mastery"
msgstr "valor, fuerza interior, compasión, maestría"

#: tarot_cards.lua:83
msgid "Leo"
msgstr "Leo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:84
msgid "8 weeks"
msgstr "8 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:85
msgid ""
"Courage. Inner strength. Master your impulses with kindness, not violence."
msgstr ""
"valor. fuerza interior. Domina tus impulsos con bondad, no con violencia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:86
msgid ""
"Weakness. Insecurity. Lack of self-control. True strength comes from "
"vulnerability."
msgstr ""
"debilidad. inseguridad. Falta de autocontrol. La verdadera fuerza nace de la "
"vulnerabilidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:90
msgid "The Hermit"
msgstr "El Ermitaño"

#: tarot_cards.lua:91
msgid "Introspection, solitude, wisdom, inner search"
msgstr "introspección, soledad, sabiduría, búsqueda interior"

#: tarot_cards.lua:92
msgid "Virgo"
msgstr "Virgo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:93
msgid "9 months, slow"
msgstr "9 meses, lento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:94
msgid ""
"Introspection. Inner wisdom. Seek silence. The light you seek is within you."
msgstr ""
"introspección. Inner sabiduría. Busca el silencio. La luz que buscas está "
"dentro de ti."

#: tarot_cards.lua:95
msgid ""
"Isolation. Loneliness. Refusing to see the truth. Prolonged retreat becomes "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"aislamiento. soledad. Negarse a ver la verdad. Un retiro prolongado se "
"convierte en evasión."

#: tarot_cards.lua:99
msgid "Wheel of Fortune"
msgstr "La Rueda de la Fortuna"

#: tarot_cards.lua:100
msgid "Change, destiny, cycles, luck"
msgstr "cambio, destino, ciclos, suerte"

#: tarot_cards.lua:101
msgid "Jupiter"
msgstr "Júpiter"

#: tarot_cards.lua:102
msgid "In motion, cyclical"
msgstr "En movimiento, cíclico"

#: tarot_cards.lua:103
msgid ""
"Change. Destiny. Luck is turning in your favor. Everything passes, cycles "
"renew."
msgstr ""
"cambio. destino. La suerte gira a tu favor. Todo pasa, los ciclos se "
"renuevan."

#: tarot_cards.lua:104
msgid ""
"Bad luck. Resistance to change. Negative cycle. Accept that nothing is "
"permanent."
msgstr ""
"Mala suerte. Resistencia al cambio. Ciclo negativo. Acepta que nada es "
"permanente."

#: tarot_cards.lua:108
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "La Justicia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:109
msgid "Balance, truth, law, cause and effect"
msgstr "equilibrio, verdad, ley, causa y efecto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:110
msgid "Libra"
msgstr "Libra"

#: tarot_cards.lua:111
msgid "Under review, fair"
msgstr "En revisión, justo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:112
msgid ""
"Balance. Truth. Justice will prevail. Reap what you have sown with serenity."
msgstr ""
"equilibrio. verdad. La justicia prevalecerá. Cosecha lo que has sembrado con "
"serenidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:113
msgid ""
"Injustice. Dishonesty. Consequences coming. The scales weigh against you now."
msgstr ""
"injusticia. deshonestidad. Consecuencias en camino. La balanza ahora pesa en "
"tu contra."

#: tarot_cards.lua:117
msgid "The Hanged Man"
msgstr "El Colgado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:118
msgid "Sacrifice, suspension, new perspective, surrender"
msgstr "sacrificio, suspensión, nueva perspectiva, rendición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:119
msgid "Neptune"
msgstr "Neptuno"

#: tarot_cards.lua:120
msgid "Indeterminate, pause"
msgstr "Indeterminado, pausa"

#: tarot_cards.lua:121
msgid ""
"Sacrifice. New perspective. Let go, trust. Sometimes stopping is advancing."
msgstr ""
"sacrificio. nueva perspectiva. Suelta y confía. A veces detenerse es avanzar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:122
msgid ""
"Stagnation. Procrastination. Resist change. The pause has become paralysis."
msgstr ""
"estancamiento. procrastinación. Resistirse al cambio. La pausa se ha "
"convertido en parálisis."

#: tarot_cards.lua:126
msgid "Death"
msgstr "La Muerte"

#: tarot_cards.lua:127
msgid "Transformation, ending, rebirth, transition"
msgstr "transformación, final, renacimiento, transición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:128
msgid "Scorpio"
msgstr "Escorpio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:129
msgid "Autumn, shortly"
msgstr "Otoño, pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:130
msgid ""
"Transformation. End of a cycle. Rebirth near. The old dies so the new can be "
"born."
msgstr ""
"transformación. Fin de un ciclo. Renacimiento cercano. Lo viejo muere para "
"que nazca lo nuevo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:131
msgid ""
"Resistance to change. Stagnation. Fear of endings. Let go of what no longer "
"serves."
msgstr ""
"Resistencia al cambio. estancamiento. Miedo a los finales. Suelta lo que ya "
"no sirve."

#: tarot_cards.lua:135
msgid "Temperance"
msgstr "La Templanza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:136
msgid "Patience, balance, moderation, harmony"
msgstr "paciencia, equilibrio, moderación, armonía"

#: tarot_cards.lua:137
msgid "Sagittarius"
msgstr "Sagitario"

#: tarot_cards.lua:138
msgid "Patience, gradual"
msgstr "Paciencia, gradual"

#: tarot_cards.lua:139
msgid "Patience. Moderation. Find balance. Water finds its level."
msgstr ""
"paciencia. moderación. Encuentra el equilibrio. El agua encuentra su nivel."

#: tarot_cards.lua:140
msgid "Excess. Impatience. Disharmony. Return to center, breathe deeply."
msgstr "exceso. Impaciencia. Desarmonía. Vuelve al centro, respira profundo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:144
msgid "The Devil"
msgstr "El Diablo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:145
msgid "Temptation, attachment, shadow, materialism"
msgstr "tentación, apego, sombra, materialismo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:146
msgid "Capricorn"
msgstr "Capricornio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:147
msgid "15 days"
msgstr "15 días"

#: tarot_cards.lua:148
msgid ""
"Temptation. Negative patterns. Free yourself from chains. You have the power "
"to break free."
msgstr ""
"tentación. Patrones negativos. Libérate de las cadenas. Tienes el poder de "
"liberarte."

#: tarot_cards.lua:149
msgid ""
"Liberation. Breaking addictions. Recovery. Light enters where darkness once "
"was."
msgstr ""
"Liberación. Ruptura de adicciones. Recuperación. La luz entra donde antes "
"había oscuridad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:153 tarot_cards.lua:833
msgid "The Tower"
msgstr "La Torre"

#: tarot_cards.lua:154
msgid "Revelation, upheaval, chaos, reconstruction"
msgstr "revelación, sacudida, caos, reconstrucción"

#: tarot_cards.lua:155
msgid "Mars"
msgstr "Marte"

#: tarot_cards.lua:156
msgid "Sudden, unexpected"
msgstr "Repentino, inesperado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:157
msgid ""
"Sudden revelation. Rupture. Necessary reconstruction. What is false crumbles."
msgstr ""
"Revelación repentina. ruptura. Reconstrucción necesaria. Lo falso se "
"derrumba."

#: tarot_cards.lua:158
msgid ""
"Avoiding disaster. Fear of change. Denial. The fall is inevitable, accept it."
msgstr ""
"Evitar el desastre. miedo of cambio. Denial. La caída es inevitable, "
"acéptala."

#: tarot_cards.lua:162 tarot_cards.lua:812
msgid "The Star"
msgstr "La Estrella"

#: tarot_cards.lua:163
msgid "Hope, faith, inspiration, renewal"
msgstr "esperanza, fe, inspiración, renovación"

#: tarot_cards.lua:164
msgid "Aquarius"
msgstr "Acuario"

#: tarot_cards.lua:165
msgid "17 days"
msgstr "17 días"

#: tarot_cards.lua:166
msgid ""
"Hope. Faith. Follow your intuition. Light guides you in darkness. Trust the "
"universe."
msgstr ""
"esperanza. fe. Sigue tu intuición. La luz te guía en la oscuridad. Confía en "
"el universo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:167
msgid ""
"Hopelessness. Lack of faith. Spiritual disconnection. The light is there, "
"you just don't see it."
msgstr ""
"desesperanza. Lack of fe. Desconexión espiritual. La luz está ahí, solo que "
"no la ves."

#: tarot_cards.lua:171 tarot_cards.lua:924
msgid "The Moon"
msgstr "La Luna"

#: tarot_cards.lua:172
msgid "Illusion, intuition, fear, subconscious"
msgstr "ilusión, intuición, miedo, subconsciente"

#: tarot_cards.lua:173
msgid "Pisces"
msgstr "Piscis"

#: tarot_cards.lua:174
msgid "28 days, nocturnal"
msgstr "28 días, nocturno"

#: tarot_cards.lua:175
msgid ""
"Illusion. Intuition. Not everything is as it seems. Walk carefully in the "
"twilight."
msgstr ""
"ilusión. intuición. No todo es lo que parece. Camina con cuidado en el "
"crepúsculo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:176
msgid "Confusion cleared. Fear overcome. Truth revealed. The fog is lifting."
msgstr ""
"Confusión aclarada. Miedo superado. Verdad revelada. La niebla se disipa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:180 tarot_cards.lua:917
msgid "The Sun"
msgstr "El Sol"

#: tarot_cards.lua:181
msgid "Joy, success, vitality, clarity"
msgstr "alegría, éxito, vitalidad, claridad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:182
msgid "Sun"
msgstr "Sol"

#: tarot_cards.lua:183
msgid "19 days, diurnal"
msgstr "19 días, diurno"

#: tarot_cards.lua:184
msgid "Joy. Success. Vitality. Everything is illuminated. Happiness overflows."
msgstr "alegría. éxito. vitalidad. Todo está iluminado. La felicidad desborda."

#: tarot_cards.lua:185
msgid ""
"Temporary sadness. Delay. Lack of enthusiasm. The sun always shines again."
msgstr ""
"Tristeza temporal. retraso. Falta de entusiasmo. El sol siempre vuelve a "
"brillar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:189
msgid "Judgement"
msgstr "El Juicio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:190
msgid "Renewal, awakening, forgiveness, calling"
msgstr "renovación, despertar, perdón, llamado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:191
msgid "Pluto"
msgstr "Plutón"

#: tarot_cards.lua:192
msgid "Renewal, awakening"
msgstr "Renovación, despertar"

#: tarot_cards.lua:193
msgid "Renewal. Inner calling. Time to awaken. The past has been forgiven."
msgstr ""
"renovación. Llamado interior. Hora de despertar. El pasado ha sido perdonado."

#: tarot_cards.lua:194
msgid ""
"Self-criticism. Regret. Denial of the calling. Free yourself from guilt."
msgstr "Self-criticism. Regret. Negación del llamado. Libérate de la culpa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:198
msgid "The World"
msgstr "El Mundo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:199
msgid "Completion, fulfillment, integration, success"
msgstr "conclusión, realización, integración, éxito"

#: tarot_cards.lua:200
msgid "Saturn"
msgstr "Saturno"

#: tarot_cards.lua:201
msgid "21 days/months, full cycle"
msgstr "21 días/meses, ciclo completo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:202
msgid ""
"Completion. Fulfillment. Cycle successfully concluded. The universe "
"celebrates with you."
msgstr ""
"conclusión. realización. Ciclo concluido con éxito. El universo celebra "
"contigo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:203
msgid ""
"Incompleteness. Delay. Lack of closure. There is still one step to take."
msgstr "incompletitud. retraso. Falta de cierre. Aún queda un paso por dar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:218
msgid "Ace"
msgstr "As"

#: tarot_cards.lua:219
msgid "Two"
msgstr "Dos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:220
msgid "Three"
msgstr "Tres"

#: tarot_cards.lua:221
msgid "Four"
msgstr "Cuatro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:222
msgid "Five"
msgstr "Cinco"

#: tarot_cards.lua:223
msgid "Six"
msgstr "Seis"

#: tarot_cards.lua:224
msgid "Seven"
msgstr "Siete"

#: tarot_cards.lua:225
msgid "Eight"
msgstr "Ocho"

#: tarot_cards.lua:226
msgid "Nine"
msgstr "Nueve"

#: tarot_cards.lua:227
msgid "Ten"
msgstr "Diez"

#: tarot_cards.lua:228
msgid "Page"
msgstr "Sota"

#: tarot_cards.lua:229
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "Caballero"

#: tarot_cards.lua:230
msgid "Queen"
msgstr "Reina"

#: tarot_cards.lua:231
msgid "King"
msgstr "Rey"

#: tarot_cards.lua:238
msgid "Ace of Wands"
msgstr "As de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:239
msgid "Inspiration, creativity, new beginning, energy"
msgstr "inspiración, creatividad, nuevo comienzo, energía"

#: tarot_cards.lua:240
msgid "Fast (days)"
msgstr "Rápido (días)"

#: tarot_cards.lua:241
msgid ""
"Creative inspiration. A new beginning full of energy. Seize the initial "
"impulse to start projects."
msgstr ""
"Inspiración creativa. A nuevo comienzo lleno de energía. Aprovecha el "
"impulso inicial para comenzar proyectos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:242
msgid ""
"False start. Procrastination. Lack of motivation. Rekindle your passion "
"before moving on."
msgstr ""
"Falso comienzo. procrastinación. Lack of motivation. Reaviva tu pasión antes "
"de avanzar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:246
msgid "Two of Wands"
msgstr "Dos de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:247
msgid "Planning, vision, decision, expansion"
msgstr "planificación, visión, decisión, expansión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:248
msgid "Weeks"
msgstr "Semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:249
msgid ""
"Planning. Looking ahead. You have the world in your hands, but you must "
"choose the path."
msgstr ""
"planificación. Mirar hacia adelante. Tienes el mundo en tus manos, pero "
"debes elegir el camino."

#: tarot_cards.lua:250
msgid ""
"Fear of the unknown. Lack of planning. Letting go of the reins. Define your "
"goals."
msgstr ""
"Miedo a lo desconocido. Lack of planificación. Soltar las riendas. Define "
"tus objetivos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:254
msgid "Three of Wands"
msgstr "Tres de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:255
msgid "Expansion, progress, anticipation, trade"
msgstr "expansión, progreso, anticipación, comercio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:256
msgid "Soon"
msgstr "Pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:257
msgid ""
"Expansion. Progress. Your plans are sailing. Await the return of the seeds "
"you planted."
msgstr ""
"expansión. progreso. Tus planes navegan. Espera el retorno de las semillas "
"que plantaste."

#: tarot_cards.lua:258
msgid ""
"Unexpected obstacles. Delay. Frustration with results. Reassess your "
"strategy."
msgstr ""
"Obstáculos inesperados. retraso. Frustración con los resultados. Reevalúa tu "
"estrategia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:262
msgid "Four of Wands"
msgstr "Cuatro de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:263
msgid "Celebration, home, harmony, stability"
msgstr "celebración, hogar, armonía, estabilidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:264
msgid "4 weeks"
msgstr "4 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:265
msgid ""
"Celebration. Harmony at home. Shared achievements. A well-deserved rest "
"after effort."
msgstr ""
"celebración. Armonía en el hogar. Logros compartidos. Un descanso merecido "
"tras el esfuerzo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:266
msgid ""
"Lack of unity. Domestic instability. Postponed celebration. Recover simple "
"joy."
msgstr ""
"Falta de unidad. Inestabilidad doméstica. Postponed celebración. Recupera la "
"alegría sencilla."

#: tarot_cards.lua:270
msgid "Five of Wands"
msgstr "Cinco de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:271
msgid "Competition, conflict, debate, growth"
msgstr "competencia, conflicto, debate, crecimiento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:272
msgid "5 weeks"
msgstr "5 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:273
msgid ""
"Healthy competition. Creative conflict. Different viewpoints enrich the "
"search."
msgstr ""
"Competencia sana. Conflicto creativo. Diferentes puntos de vista enriquecen "
"la búsqueda."

#: tarot_cards.lua:274
msgid ""
"Internal quarrels. Avoiding confrontation. Energy drain. Seek cooperation "
"instead of dispute."
msgstr ""
"Disputas internas. Evitar la confrontación. Desgaste energético. Busca "
"cooperación en lugar de disputa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:278
msgid "Six of Wands"
msgstr "Seis de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:279
msgid "Victory, recognition, triumph, confidence"
msgstr "victoria, reconocimiento, triunfo, confianza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:280
msgid "6 weeks"
msgstr "6 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:281
msgid ""
"Victory. Public recognition. High self-esteem. Reap the laurels with "
"humility."
msgstr ""
"victoria. Reconocimiento público. Alta autoestima. Recibe los laureles con "
"humildad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:282
msgid "Inflated ego. Short-lived recognition. Envy. True victory is internal."
msgstr ""
"Ego inflado. Reconocimiento pasajero. Envy. La verdadera victoria es interna."

#: tarot_cards.lua:286
msgid "Seven of Wands"
msgstr "Siete de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:287
msgid "Defense, perseverance, courage, resistance"
msgstr "defensa, perseverancia, valor, resistencia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:289
msgid ""
"Defense of positions. Perseverance. Stand firm despite opposition. You have "
"the upper hand."
msgstr ""
"Defensa de posiciones. perseverancia. Mantente firme pese a la oposición. "
"Tienes ventaja."

#: tarot_cards.lua:290
msgid ""
"Exhaustion. Feeling cornered. Giving up. Reinforce your boundaries wisely."
msgstr ""
"Exhaustion. Sentirse acorralado. Rendirse. Refuerza tus límites con "
"sabiduría."

#: tarot_cards.lua:294
msgid "Eight of Wands"
msgstr "Ocho de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:295
msgid "Speed, action, progress, communication"
msgstr "velocidad, acción, progreso, comunicación"

#: tarot_cards.lua:296
msgid "Very fast"
msgstr "Muy rápido"

#: tarot_cards.lua:297
msgid ""
"Swift movement. News arriving. Accelerated action. Take advantage of the "
"tailwind."
msgstr ""
"Movimiento rápido. Noticias que llegan. Acción acelerada. Aprovecha el "
"viento a favor."

#: tarot_cards.lua:298
msgid ""
"Delay. Lack of direction. Scattered energy. Wait for the right moment to act."
msgstr ""
"retraso. Falta de dirección. Energía dispersa. Espera el momento adecuado "
"para actuar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:302
msgid "Nine of Wands"
msgstr "Nueve de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:303
msgid "Resilience, persistence, last stand, fatigue"
msgstr "resiliencia, persistencia, last stand, fatiga"

#: tarot_cards.lua:304
msgid "9 weeks"
msgstr "9 semanas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:305
msgid ""
"Resilience. Last battle. You are almost there, even if tired. Keep your "
"guard up."
msgstr ""
"Resiliencia. Última batalla. Ya casi llegas, aunque estés cansado. Mantén la "
"guardia alta."

#: tarot_cards.lua:306
msgid ""
"Stubbornness. Refusing help. Exhaustion. Let down your defense and allow "
"yourself to rest."
msgstr ""
"Terquedad. Rechazo de ayuda. Agotamiento. Baja la defensa y permítete "
"descansar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:310
msgid "Ten of Wands"
msgstr "Diez de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:311
msgid "Overload, responsibility, burden, effort"
msgstr "Overload, responsabilidad, carga, effort"

#: tarot_cards.lua:312
msgid "10 weeks, end of cycle"
msgstr "10 semanas, fin de ciclo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:313
msgid ""
"Overload. Heavy responsibilities. The burden is great, but the end is near. "
"Delegate tasks."
msgstr ""
"Sobrecarga. Responsabilidades pesadas. La carga es grande, pero el final "
"está cerca. Delega tareas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:314
msgid ""
"Inability to delegate. Burnout. Refusing help. Let go of what doesn't belong "
"to you."
msgstr ""
"Incapacidad de delegar. Agotamiento. Rechazo de ayuda. Suelta lo que no te "
"pertenece."

#: tarot_cards.lua:318
msgid "Page of Wands"
msgstr "Sota de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:319
msgid "Enthusiasm, exploration, discovery, new idea"
msgstr "Entusiasmo, exploración, discovery, new idea"

#: tarot_cards.lua:320
msgid "Youthful, fast"
msgstr "Juvenil, rápido"

#: tarot_cards.lua:321
msgid ""
"Enthusiasm. New ideas. A young messenger brings inspiration. Explore your "
"curiosity without fear."
msgstr ""
"Entusiasmo. Nueva ideas. Un joven mensajero trae inspiración. Explora tu "
"curiosidad sin miedo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:322
msgid ""
"Lack of plans. Impulsiveness. Ideas without execution. Set goals before "
"acting."
msgstr ""
"Falta de planes. Impulsividad. Ideas sin ejecución. Define metas antes de "
"actuar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:326
msgid "Knight of Wands"
msgstr "Caballero de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:327
msgid "Action, passion, impulse, adventure"
msgstr "acción, pasión, impulse, aventura"

#: tarot_cards.lua:328
msgid "Immediate, intense"
msgstr "Inmediato, intenso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:329
msgid ""
"Passionate action. Courage to take risks. Go ahead boldly, but don't forget "
"the destination."
msgstr ""
"Acción apasionada. Valor para asumir riesgos. Avanza con audacia, pero no "
"olvides el destino."

#: tarot_cards.lua:330
msgid ""
"Impatience. Rushing without direction. Conflict. Slow down and choose the "
"right path."
msgstr ""
"Impaciencia. Prisa sin dirección. Conflicto. Ve más despacio y elige el "
"camino correcto."

#: tarot_cards.lua:334
msgid "Queen of Wands"
msgstr "Reina de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:335
msgid "Charisma, leadership, warmth, confidence"
msgstr "carisma, liderazgo, warmth, confianza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:336
msgid "Summer, mature"
msgstr "Verano, maduro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:337
msgid ""
"Warmth, determination and magnetism. Inspiring leadership. Use your charisma "
"to attract what you want."
msgstr ""
"Calidez, determinación y magnetismo. Liderazgo inspirador. Usa tu carisma "
"para atraer lo que deseas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:338
msgid ""
"Jealousy. Insecurity. Explosive temper. The inner flame can burn those "
"nearby."
msgstr ""
"Celos. Inseguridad. Temperamento explosivo. La llama interior puede quemar a "
"quienes están cerca."

#: tarot_cards.lua:342
msgid "King of Wands"
msgstr "Rey de Bastos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:343
msgid "Vision, entrepreneurship, authority, honor"
msgstr "Visión, emprendimiento, autoridad, honor"

#: tarot_cards.lua:344
msgid "Long term, leadership"
msgstr "Largo plazo, liderazgo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:345
msgid ""
"Entrepreneurial vision. Strong leadership. Take command with integrity and "
"inspire others."
msgstr ""
"Visión emprendedora. Liderazgo fuerte. Toma el mando con integridad e "
"inspira a los demás."

#: tarot_cards.lua:346
msgid ""
"Authoritarianism. Empty promises. Lack of vision. Leading by fear builds "
"nothing lasting."
msgstr ""
"Autoritarismo. Promesas vacías. Falta de visión. Liderar con miedo no "
"construye nada duradero."

#: tarot_cards.lua:352
msgid "Ace of Cups"
msgstr "As de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:353
msgid "Love, emotion, intuition, new feeling"
msgstr "Amor, emoción, intuición, nuevo sentimiento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:354
msgid "Lunar, emotional"
msgstr "Lunar, emocional"

#: tarot_cards.lua:355
msgid ""
"Overflowing love. New emotional cycle. Open yourself to deep feelings and "
"true connections."
msgstr ""
"Amor desbordante. Nuevo ciclo emocional. Ábrete a sentimientos profundos y "
"conexiones verdaderas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:356
msgid ""
"Repressed love. Emotional block. Inner emptiness. Allow yourself to feel in "
"order to heal."
msgstr ""
"Amor reprimido. Bloqueo emocional. Vacío interior. Permítete sentir para "
"sanar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:360
msgid "Two of Cups"
msgstr "Dos de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:361
msgid "Union, partnership, commitment, attraction"
msgstr "Unión, alianza, compromiso, atracción"

#: tarot_cards.lua:362
msgid "Meeting soon"
msgstr "Encuentro pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:363
msgid ""
"Union. Loving partnership. Soul meeting. Mutual respect and commitment "
"strengthen the bond."
msgstr ""
"Unión. Alianza amorosa. Encuentro de almas. El respeto mutuo y el compromiso "
"fortalecen el vínculo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:364
msgid ""
"Disconnection. Quarrels. Emotional imbalance. A sincere conversation can "
"restore harmony."
msgstr ""
"Desconexión. Peleas. Desequilibrio emocional. Una conversación sincera puede "
"restaurar la armonía."

#: tarot_cards.lua:368
msgid "Three of Cups"
msgstr "Tres de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:369
msgid "Friendship, celebration, community, joy"
msgstr "amistad, celebración, comunidad, alegría"

#: tarot_cards.lua:370
msgid "Social event"
msgstr "Evento social"

#: tarot_cards.lua:371
msgid ""
"Friendship. Celebration. Shared joy. Gather with those you love and "
"celebrate life."
msgstr ""
"Amistad. Celebración. Alegría compartida. Reúnete con quienes amas y celebra "
"la vida."

#: tarot_cards.lua:372
msgid ""
"Gossip. Isolation. Excess partying. Beware of superficial friendships and "
"hidden resentments."
msgstr ""
"Chismes. aislamiento. Fiesta excesiva. Cuidado con amistades superficiales y "
"resentimientos ocultos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:376
msgid "Four of Cups"
msgstr "Cuatro de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:377
msgid "Contemplation, apathy, boredom, introspection"
msgstr "Contemplation, apatía, boredom, introspección"

#: tarot_cards.lua:378
msgid "Stagnant"
msgstr "Estancado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:379
msgid ""
"Contemplation. Apathy. New invitation ignored. Look beyond boredom to notice "
"opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Contemplación. Apatía. Nueva invitación ignorada. Mira más allá del "
"aburrimiento para notar oportunidades."

#: tarot_cards.lua:380
msgid ""
"Awakening. Acceptance. New perspectives. Leave your comfort zone and seize "
"the chance offered."
msgstr ""
"Despertar. Acceptance. Nuevas perspectivas. Sal de tu zona de confort y "
"aprovecha la oportunidad ofrecida."

#: tarot_cards.lua:384
msgid "Five of Cups"
msgstr "Cinco de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:385
msgid "Grief, loss, regret, focus on negative"
msgstr "Duelo, pérdida, arrepentimiento, foco en lo negativo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:386
msgid "Recent past"
msgstr "Pasado reciente"

#: tarot_cards.lua:387
msgid ""
"Grief. Loss. Focus on what is gone. Two cups still stand – look at what "
"remains."
msgstr ""
"Duelo. Pérdida. Foco en lo que se fue. Dos copas aún permanecen: mira lo que "
"queda."

#: tarot_cards.lua:388
msgid ""
"Overcoming. Recovery. Learning from pain. Accept the past and move forward."
msgstr ""
"Superación. Recuperación. Aprendizaje desde el dolor. Acepta el pasado y "
"sigue adelante."

#: tarot_cards.lua:392
msgid "Six of Cups"
msgstr "Seis de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:393
msgid "Nostalgia, memory, childhood, gift"
msgstr "nostalgia, memoria, childhood, regalo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:394
msgid "Revisiting the past"
msgstr "Revisitar el pasado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:395
msgid ""
"Nostalgia. Fond memories. Reunion with the past. Cherish your roots with "
"affection."
msgstr ""
"Nostalgia. Recuerdos queridos. Reencuentro con el pasado. Valora tus raíces "
"con afecto."

#: tarot_cards.lua:396
msgid ""
"Clinging to the past. Immaturity. Inability to move on. Live the present."
msgstr ""
"Aferrarse al pasado. Inmadurez. Incapacidad de avanzar. Vive el presente."

#: tarot_cards.lua:400
msgid "Seven of Cups"
msgstr "Siete de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:401
msgid "Illusion, choices, fantasy, dreams"
msgstr "Ilusión, elecciones, fantasía, sueños"

#: tarot_cards.lua:402
msgid "Confusing, indefinite"
msgstr "Confuso, indefinido"

#: tarot_cards.lua:403
msgid ""
"Illusions. Fantasies. Multiple options. Discernment is needed to choose the "
"true cup."
msgstr ""
"Ilusiones. Fantasías. Múltiples opciones. Hace falta discernimiento para "
"elegir la copa verdadera."

#: tarot_cards.lua:404
msgid "Clarity. Firm decision. End of illusions. Focus on what really matters."
msgstr ""
"Claridad. Decisión firme. Fin de las ilusiones. Enfócate en lo que realmente "
"importa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:408
msgid "Eight of Cups"
msgstr "Ocho de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:409
msgid "Withdrawal, search, disillusion, departure"
msgstr "Retiro, búsqueda, desilusión, partida"

#: tarot_cards.lua:410
msgid "Emotional transition"
msgstr "Emotional transición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:411
msgid ""
"Withdrawal. Spiritual search. Leaving behind what doesn't fulfill. Follow "
"your intuition."
msgstr ""
"Retiro. Búsqueda espiritual. Dejar atrás lo que no llena. Sigue tu intuición."

#: tarot_cards.lua:412
msgid ""
"Fear of change. Staying out of convenience. Silent dissatisfaction. Courage "
"to leave."
msgstr ""
"Miedo al cambio. Permanecer por conveniencia. Insatisfacción silenciosa. "
"Valor para marcharse."

#: tarot_cards.lua:416
msgid "Nine of Cups"
msgstr "Nueve de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:417
msgid "Wish fulfilled, satisfaction, contentment, luxury"
msgstr "Deseo cumplido, satisfacción, contento, lujo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:418
msgid "Soon fulfillment"
msgstr "Realización próxima"

#: tarot_cards.lua:419
msgid ""
"Wish fulfilled. Satisfaction. The “dream cup” is full. Enjoy emotional "
"abundance."
msgstr ""
"Deseo cumplido. Satisfacción. La “copa soñada” está llena. Disfruta la "
"abundancia emocional."

#: tarot_cards.lua:420
msgid ""
"Dissatisfaction. Unmet desires. Empty materialism. True happiness lies in "
"simplicity."
msgstr ""
"Insatisfacción. Deseos no cumplidos. Materialismo vacío. La verdadera "
"felicidad está en la sencillez."

#: tarot_cards.lua:424
msgid "Ten of Cups"
msgstr "Diez de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:425
msgid "Happiness, family, harmony, blessing"
msgstr "Felicidad, familia, armonía, bendición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:426
msgid "Happy ending"
msgstr "Final feliz"

#: tarot_cards.lua:427
msgid ""
"Full happiness. Family love. Lasting harmony. The heart overflows with "
"shared joy."
msgstr ""
"Felicidad plena. Amor familiar. Armonía duradera. El corazón desborda "
"alegría compartida."

#: tarot_cards.lua:428
msgid ""
"Family conflicts. Broken bonds. Idealization of happiness. Work on emotional "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"Conflictos familiares. Vínculos rotos. Idealización de la felicidad. Trabaja "
"la comunicación emocional."

#: tarot_cards.lua:432
msgid "Page of Cups"
msgstr "Sota de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:433
msgid "Sensitivity, creativity, message, intuition"
msgstr "Sensibilidad, creatividad, mensaje, intuición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:434
msgid "Emotional surprise"
msgstr "Sorpresa emocional"

#: tarot_cards.lua:435
msgid ""
"Creative sensitivity. Message of love. Open up to intuition and heart "
"surprises."
msgstr ""
"Sensibilidad creativa. Mensaje de amor. Ábrete a la intuición y a las "
"sorpresas del corazón."

#: tarot_cards.lua:436
msgid ""
"Emotional immaturity. Love disappointment. Childish jealousy. Put fantasy "
"aside and face reality."
msgstr ""
"Inmadurez emocional. Decepción amorosa. Celos infantiles. Deja la fantasía a "
"un lado y enfrenta la realidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:440
msgid "Knight of Cups"
msgstr "Caballero de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:441
msgid "Romanticism, charm, proposal, idealism"
msgstr "Romanticismo, encanto, propuesta, idealismo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:442
msgid "Invitation soon"
msgstr "Invitación pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:443
msgid ""
"Romanticism. Charming proposal. Search for the beautiful and ideal. Follow "
"your heart with elegance."
msgstr ""
"Romanticismoo. Propuesta encantadora. Búsqueda de lo bello y lo ideal. Sigue "
"tu corazón con elegancia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:444
msgid ""
"Love illusion. Empty promises. Excess of idealization. Keep your feet on the "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"Ilusión amorosa. Promesas vacías. Exceso de idealización. Mantén los pies en "
"la tierra."

#: tarot_cards.lua:448
msgid "Queen of Cups"
msgstr "Reina de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:449
msgid "Empathy, intuition, care, compassion"
msgstr "Empatía, intuición, cuidado, compasión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:450
msgid "Lunar cycle, mature"
msgstr "Ciclo lunar, maduro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:451
msgid ""
"Deep intuition. Empathy. Emotional caregiver. Trust your ability to love and "
"heal."
msgstr ""
"Intuición profunda. Empatía. Cuidado emocional. Confía en tu capacidad de "
"amar y sanar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:452
msgid ""
"Emotional dependence. Exacerbated sensitivity. Emotional manipulation. Set "
"healthy boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Emotional dependencia. Sensibilidad exacerbada. Emotional manipulación. "
"Establece límites saludables."

#: tarot_cards.lua:456
msgid "King of Cups"
msgstr "Rey de Copas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:457
msgid "Emotional mastery, diplomacy, calm, wisdom"
msgstr "Maestría emocional, diplomacy, calm, sabiduría"

#: tarot_cards.lua:458
msgid "Emotional stability"
msgstr "Estabilidad emocional"

#: tarot_cards.lua:459
msgid ""
"Emotional mastery. Mature compassion. Leadership with heart. Calm turbulent "
"waters with wisdom."
msgstr ""
"Maestría emocional. Compasión madura. Liderazgo con corazón. Calma las aguas "
"turbulentas con sabiduría."

#: tarot_cards.lua:460
msgid ""
"Coldness. Emotional repression. Manipulation. The repressed heart becomes a "
"silent tyrant."
msgstr ""
"Frialdad. Represión emocional. Manipulación. El corazón reprimido se vuelve "
"un tirano silencioso."

#: tarot_cards.lua:466
msgid "Ace of Swords"
msgstr "As de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:467
msgid "Clarity, truth, justice, sharp mind"
msgstr "claridad, verdad, justicia, sharp mind"

#: tarot_cards.lua:468
msgid "Quick decision"
msgstr "Quick decisión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:469
msgid ""
"Mental clarity. Truth revealed. Sharp idea. Use the power of the word with "
"justice."
msgstr ""
"Claridad mental. Verdad revelada. Idea afilada. Usa el poder de la palabra "
"con justicia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:470
msgid ""
"Confusion. Lies. Verbal abuse. Distorted truth hurts. Seek clean "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"Confusión. Mentiras. Abuso verbal. La verdad distorsionada hiere. Busca una "
"comunicación limpia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:474
msgid "Two of Swords"
msgstr "Dos de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:475
msgid "Impasse, difficult choice, denial, balance"
msgstr "Impasse, difficult elección, denial, equilibrio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:476
msgid "Stalled"
msgstr "Detenido"

#: tarot_cards.lua:477
msgid ""
"Difficult decision. Impasse. Precarious balance. Remove the blindfold and "
"face the situation."
msgstr ""
"Decisión difícil. Impasse. Equilibrio precario. Quítate la venda y enfrenta "
"la situación."

#: tarot_cards.lua:478
msgid ""
"Postponed decision. Escape from truth. Internal conflict. Free yourself from "
"paralysis and choose."
msgstr ""
"Decisión pospuesta. Huida de la verdad. Internal conflicto. Libérate de la "
"parálisis y elige."

#: tarot_cards.lua:482
msgid "Three of Swords"
msgstr "Tres de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:483
msgid "Pain, betrayal, sadness, heartbreak"
msgstr "dolor, traición, sadness, heartbreak"

#: tarot_cards.lua:484
msgid "Recent pain"
msgstr "Recent dolor"

#: tarot_cards.lua:485
msgid ""
"Emotional pain. Betrayal. Broken heart. Suffering is real, but it's the "
"first step toward healing."
msgstr ""
"Dolor emocional. traición. Corazón roto. El sufrimiento es real, pero es el "
"primer paso hacia la sanación."

#: tarot_cards.lua:486
msgid ""
"Slow recovery. Holding grudges. Difficulty forgiving. Free yourself from the "
"poison of resentment."
msgstr ""
"Recuperación lenta. Guardar rencor. Dificultad para perdonar. Libérate del "
"veneno del resentimiento."

#: tarot_cards.lua:490
msgid "Four of Swords"
msgstr "Cuatro de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:491
msgid "Rest, recovery, contemplation, pause"
msgstr "descanso, recovery, contemplation, pause"

#: tarot_cards.lua:492
msgid "Necessary pause"
msgstr "Pausa necesaria"

#: tarot_cards.lua:493
msgid ""
"Mental rest. Retreat. Recovery. Step away from the noise and recharge your "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"Descanso mental. Retiro. Recuperación. Aléjate del ruido y recarga tu mente."

#: tarot_cards.lua:494
msgid ""
"Insomnia. Mental exhaustion. Inability to relax. Excessive thinking makes "
"you sick."
msgstr ""
"Insomnio. Agotamiento mental. Incapacidad de relajarse. Pensar en exceso "
"enferma."

#: tarot_cards.lua:498
msgid "Five of Swords"
msgstr "Cinco de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:499
msgid "Conflict, defeat, hostility, hollow victory"
msgstr "conflicto, derrota, hostility, hollow victoria"

#: tarot_cards.lua:500
msgid "Current conflict"
msgstr "Conflicto actual"

#: tarot_cards.lua:501
msgid ""
"Conflict. Empty victory. Humiliation. Sometimes winning the battle means "
"losing the war."
msgstr ""
"Conflicto. Victoria vacía. Humillación. A veces ganar la batalla significa "
"perder la guerra."

#: tarot_cards.lua:502
msgid ""
"Reconciliation. Remorse. Putting pride aside. Seek peace instead of being "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Reconciliación. Remordimiento. Dejar el orgullo de lado. Busca la paz antes "
"que tener la razón."

#: tarot_cards.lua:506
msgid "Six of Swords"
msgstr "Seis de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:507
msgid "Transition, healing, journey, moving on"
msgstr "Transición, healing, journey, moving on"

#: tarot_cards.lua:508
msgid "Gradual transition"
msgstr "Transición gradual"

#: tarot_cards.lua:509
msgid ""
"Smooth transition. Healing journey. Leaving turbulent waters behind. Toward "
"calm waters."
msgstr ""
"Transición suave. Viaje de sanación. Dejar atrás aguas turbulentas. Rumbo a "
"aguas tranquilas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:510
msgid ""
"Resistance to change. Emotional baggage. Staying stuck in the problem. "
"Release what you cannot carry."
msgstr ""
"Resistencia al cambio. Equipaje emocional. Quedarse atrapado en el problema. "
"Suelta lo que no puedes cargar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:514
msgid "Seven of Swords"
msgstr "Siete de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:515
msgid "Strategy, deception, escape, cunning"
msgstr "Estrategia, engaño, escape, astucia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:516
msgid "Fast, stealthy"
msgstr "Rápido, sigiloso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:517
msgid ""
"Strategy. Subtle escape. Not everything needs to be faced head-on. Act with "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Estrategia. Escape sutil. No todo necesita enfrentarse de frente. Actúa con "
"inteligencia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:518
msgid ""
"Deception. Theft. Lack of ethics. Lies have short legs. Act with honesty."
msgstr ""
"Engaño. Robo. Falta de ética. Las mentiras tienen patas cortas. Actúa con "
"honestidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:522
msgid "Eight of Swords"
msgstr "Ocho de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:523
msgid "Imprisonment, self-sabotage, limitation, fear"
msgstr "Imprisonment, self-sabotage, limitation, miedo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:524
msgid "Mental prison, temporary"
msgstr "Prisión mental, temporal"

#: tarot_cards.lua:525
msgid ""
"Feeling trapped. Self-sabotage. Imaginary limitations. The prison is mental "
"– the key is within you."
msgstr ""
"Sentirse atrapado. Autosabotaje. Limitaciones imaginarias. La prisión es "
"mental: la llave está dentro de ti."

#: tarot_cards.lua:526
msgid ""
"Liberation. New perspective. Overcoming limiting beliefs. Break the bonds "
"and see the light."
msgstr ""
"Liberación. nueva perspectiva. Superación de creencias limitantes. Rompe los "
"lazos y mira la luz."

#: tarot_cards.lua:530
msgid "Nine of Swords"
msgstr "Nueve de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:531
msgid "Anxiety, nightmare, worry, anguish"
msgstr "Ansiedad, nightmare, preocupación, anguish"

#: tarot_cards.lua:532
msgid "Nocturnal, insomnia"
msgstr "Nocturno, insomnio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:533
msgid ""
"Anxiety. Nightmares. Nocturnal worries. The mind is its own tormentor. Seek "
"to calm your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Ansiedad. Pesadillas. Preocupaciones nocturnas. La mente es su propio "
"tormento. Busca calmar tus pensamientos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:534
msgid ""
"Recovery from anguish. Learning from pain. The worst is over. Take a deep "
"breath."
msgstr ""
"Recuperación de la angustia. Aprendizaje desde el dolor. Lo peor ya pasó. "
"Respira profundo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:538
msgid "Ten of Swords"
msgstr "Diez de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:539
msgid "Painful ending, betrayal, crisis, rebirth"
msgstr "Painful final, traición, crisis, renacimiento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:540
msgid "Rock bottom, new dawn"
msgstr "Fondo del pozo, nuevo amanecer"

#: tarot_cards.lua:541
msgid ""
"Painful ending. Final betrayal. Rock bottom. From this abyss one can only "
"rise – dawn arrives."
msgstr ""
"Painful final. Traición final. Fondo del pozo. Desde este abismo solo se "
"puede subir: llega el amanecer."

#: tarot_cards.lua:542
msgid ""
"Recovery. Resistance. Avoiding the final collapse. Suffering can be "
"transformed into strength."
msgstr ""
"Recuperación. resistencia. Evitar el colapso final. El sufrimiento puede "
"transformarse en fuerza."

#: tarot_cards.lua:546
msgid "Page of Swords"
msgstr "Sota de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:547
msgid "Curiosity, communication, ideas, vigilance"
msgstr "Curiosidad, comunicación, ideas, vigilancia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:548
msgid "News shortly"
msgstr "Noticias pronto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:549
msgid ""
"Intellectual curiosity. New ideas. Agile communication. Speak your truth, "
"but with tact."
msgstr ""
"Curiosidad intelectual. Nuevas ideas. Comunicación ágil. Di tu verdad, pero "
"con tacto."

#: tarot_cards.lua:550
msgid ""
"Gossip. Superficial thinking. Baseless criticism. Use your mind to build, "
"not destroy."
msgstr ""
"Chismes. Pensamiento superficial. Crítica sin base. Usa tu mente para "
"construir, no para destruir."

#: tarot_cards.lua:554
msgid "Knight of Swords"
msgstr "Caballero de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:555
msgid "Swift action, impulse, determination, conflict"
msgstr "Swift acción, impulse, determinación, conflicto"

#: tarot_cards.lua:556
msgid "Now, urgent"
msgstr "Ahora, urgente"

#: tarot_cards.lua:557
msgid ""
"Impetuous action. Intellectual determination. Advance with momentum, but "
"don't trample others."
msgstr ""
"Acción impetuosa. Determinación intelectual. Avanza con impulso, pero no "
"atropelles a los demás."

#: tarot_cards.lua:558
msgid ""
"Blind impulsiveness. Unnecessary confrontation. Aggressiveness. Think before "
"brandishing the sword."
msgstr ""
"Impulsividad ciega. Confrontación innecesaria. Aggressiveness. Piensa antes "
"de blandir la espada."

#: tarot_cards.lua:562
msgid "Queen of Swords"
msgstr "Reina de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:563
msgid "Rationality, independence, discernment, truth"
msgstr "racionalidad, independencia, discernimiento, verdad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:564
msgid "Mature decision"
msgstr "Decisión madura"

#: tarot_cards.lua:565
msgid ""
"Clear rationality. Independence. Weighted justice. Make decisions with the "
"mind, but without losing empathy."
msgstr ""
"Racionalidad clara. independencia. Justicia ponderada. Toma decisiones con "
"la mente, pero sin perder empatía."

#: tarot_cards.lua:566
msgid ""
"Emotional coldness. Bitterness. Harsh judgment. Reason without heart becomes "
"cruelty."
msgstr ""
"Frialdad emocional. Amargura. Juicio severo. La razón sin corazón se vuelve "
"crueldad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:570
msgid "King of Swords"
msgstr "Rey de Espadas"

#: tarot_cards.lua:571
msgid "Intellectual authority, ethics, clarity, justice"
msgstr "Autoridad intelectual, ética, claridad, justicia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:572
msgid "Legal authority, long term"
msgstr "Autoridad legal, largo plazo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:573
msgid ""
"Intellectual authority. Ethics. Just and lucid leadership. Truth is your "
"sharpest sword."
msgstr ""
"Autoridad intelectual. ética. Liderazgo justo y lúcido. La verdad es tu "
"espada más afilada."

#: tarot_cards.lua:574
msgid ""
"Mental tyranny. Manipulation of truth. Abuse of power. Intellect without "
"morals oppresses."
msgstr ""
"Tiranía mental. Manipulación de la verdad. Abuso de poder. El intelecto sin "
"moral oprime."

#: tarot_cards.lua:580
msgid "Ace of Pentacles"
msgstr "As de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:581
msgid "Opportunity, prosperity, new resource, security"
msgstr "oportunidad, prosperidad, new recurso, seguridad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:582
msgid "Material beginning"
msgstr "Comienzo material"

#: tarot_cards.lua:583
msgid ""
"New material opportunity. Prosperity at hand. Get to work to reap solid "
"fruits."
msgstr ""
"Nueva oportunidad material. Prosperidad al alcance. Ponte a trabajar para "
"cosechar frutos sólidos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:584
msgid ""
"Missed opportunity. Greed. Financial delay. The foundation needs to be set "
"before growing."
msgstr ""
"Oportunidad perdida. Greed. Retraso financiero. La base debe asentarse antes "
"de crecer."

#: tarot_cards.lua:588
msgid "Two of Pentacles"
msgstr "Dos de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:589
msgid "Balance, adaptation, juggling, priorities"
msgstr "equilibrio, adaptación, juggling, prioridades"

#: tarot_cards.lua:590
msgid "Fluctuating"
msgstr "Fluctuante"

#: tarot_cards.lua:591
msgid ""
"Financial balance. Juggling. Adapt to changes without losing control of your "
"accounts."
msgstr ""
"Equilibrio financiero. Juggling. Adáptate a los cambios sin perder el "
"control de tus cuentas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:592
msgid ""
"Disorganization. Debt overload. Inability to prioritize. Reorganize your "
"finances."
msgstr ""
"Disorganization. Sobrecarga de deudas. Incapacidad de priorizar. Reorganiza "
"tus finanzas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:596
msgid "Three of Pentacles"
msgstr "Tres de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:597
msgid "Teamwork, collaboration, mastery, skill"
msgstr "Trabajo en equipo, colaboración, maestría, habilidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:598
msgid "Project in progress"
msgstr "Proyecto en progreso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:599
msgid ""
"Teamwork. Mastery. Productive collaboration. Together, the result is greater "
"than the sum."
msgstr ""
"Trabajo en equipo. maestría. Colaboración productiva. Juntos, el resultado "
"es mayor que la suma."

#: tarot_cards.lua:600
msgid ""
"Lack of collaboration. Carelessness. Poor workmanship. Restore respect for "
"excellence."
msgstr ""
"Lack of colaboración. Carelessness. Trabajo deficiente. Restaura el respeto "
"por la excelencia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:604
msgid "Four of Pentacles"
msgstr "Cuatro de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:605
msgid "Security, attachment, saving, control"
msgstr "seguridad, apego, ahorro, control"

#: tarot_cards.lua:606
msgid "Stable, stagnant"
msgstr "Estable, estancado"

#: tarot_cards.lua:607
msgid ""
"Material security. Attachment to possessions. Healthy saving, but without "
"closing off to the new."
msgstr ""
"Seguridad material. Apego a las posesiones. Ahorro sano, pero sin cerrarte a "
"lo nuevo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:608
msgid ""
"Miserliness. Fear of loss. Blocking abundance. Let go a little control to "
"receive."
msgstr ""
"Tacañería. Miedo a perder. Bloqueo de la abundancia. Suelta un poco el "
"control para recibir."

#: tarot_cards.lua:612
msgid "Five of Pentacles"
msgstr "Cinco de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:613
msgid "Hardship, scarcity, exclusion, aid"
msgstr "dificultad, escasez, exclusión, ayuda"

#: tarot_cards.lua:614
msgid "Difficult period"
msgstr "Periodo difícil"

#: tarot_cards.lua:615
msgid ""
"Material hardship. Feeling of exclusion. Help is closer than you think. Ask "
"for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Dificultad material. Sensación de exclusión. La ayuda está más cerca de lo "
"que crees. Pide ayuda."

#: tarot_cards.lua:616
msgid ""
"Financial recovery. End of scarcity. Re-inclusion. Light shines at the end "
"of the tunnel."
msgstr ""
"Recuperación financiera. Fin de la escasez. Re-inclusion. La luz brilla al "
"final del túnel."

#: tarot_cards.lua:620
msgid "Six of Pentacles"
msgstr "Seis de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:621
msgid "Generosity, sharing, charity, balance"
msgstr "generosidad, compartir, caridad, equilibrio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:622
msgid "Give and receive"
msgstr "Dar y recibir"

#: tarot_cards.lua:623
msgid ""
"Generosity. Sharing. Giving and receiving in balance. Prosperity circulates "
"when the hand opens."
msgstr ""
"generosidad. compartir. Dar y recibir en equilibrio. La prosperidad circula "
"cuando la mano se abre."

#: tarot_cards.lua:624
msgid ""
"Self-interested charity. Debts. Imbalance in giving. Beware of those who "
"only ask and never give back."
msgstr ""
"Caridad interesada. Deudas. Desequilibrio al dar. Cuidado con quienes solo "
"piden y nunca devuelven."

#: tarot_cards.lua:628
msgid "Seven of Pentacles"
msgstr "Siete de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:629
msgid "Patience, harvest, evaluation, investment"
msgstr "paciencia, cosecha, evaluación, inversión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:630
msgid "Long term"
msgstr "Largo plazo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:631
msgid ""
"Patience. Harvest in progress. Evaluate if your efforts are yielding the "
"expected fruits."
msgstr ""
"paciencia. Cosecha en progreso. Evalúa si tus esfuerzos están dando los "
"frutos esperados."

#: tarot_cards.lua:632
msgid ""
"Impatience. Fruitless work. Frustration with results. Recalculate the route "
"and continue."
msgstr ""
"Impaciencia. Trabajo infructuoso. Frustración con los resultados. Recalcula "
"la ruta y continúa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:636
msgid "Eight of Pentacles"
msgstr "Ocho de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:637
msgid "Dedication, learning, improvement, work"
msgstr "dedicación, aprendizaje, mejora, trabajo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:638
msgid "Daily, constant"
msgstr "Diario, constante"

#: tarot_cards.lua:639
msgid ""
"Dedicated learning. Craftsmanship. Constant improvement. Mastery requires "
"daily practice."
msgstr ""
"Aprendizaje dedicado. Artesanía. Mejora constante. La maestría requiere "
"práctica diaria."

#: tarot_cards.lua:640
msgid ""
"Perfectionism. Monotonous work. Lack of motivation. Rekindle the pleasure in "
"doing."
msgstr ""
"Perfeccionismo. Trabajo monótono. Lack of motivation. Reaviva el placer de "
"hacer."

#: tarot_cards.lua:644
msgid "Nine of Pentacles"
msgstr "Nueve de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:645
msgid "Self-sufficiency, luxury, achievement, independence"
msgstr "Autosuficiencia, lujo, logro, independencia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:646
msgid "Personal harvest"
msgstr "Cosecha personal"

#: tarot_cards.lua:647
msgid ""
"Self-sufficiency. Personal luxury. Material achievement with independence. "
"Enjoy what you have built."
msgstr ""
"Autosuficiencia. Lujo personal. Logro material con independencia. Disfruta "
"lo que has construido."

#: tarot_cards.lua:648
msgid ""
"Financial dependence. Empty ostentation. Material insecurity. Real value "
"lies in who you are."
msgstr ""
"Dependencia financiera. Ostentación vacía. Material inseguridad. El valor "
"real está en quién eres."

#: tarot_cards.lua:652
msgid "Ten of Pentacles"
msgstr "Diez de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:653
msgid "Wealth, legacy, family, stability"
msgstr "riqueza, legado, familia, estabilidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:654
msgid "Permanent, long term"
msgstr "Permanente, largo plazo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:655
msgid ""
"Lasting wealth. Family legacy. Material and emotional security. Strong roots "
"nourish the future."
msgstr ""
"Riqueza duradera. Legado familiar. Seguridad material y emocional. Raíces "
"fuertes nutren el futuro."

#: tarot_cards.lua:656
msgid ""
"Loss of inheritance. Family conflicts over money. Financial instability. "
"Rebuild the foundations."
msgstr ""
"Pérdida de herencia. Conflictos familiares por dinero. Inestabilidad "
"financiera. Reconstruye los cimientos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:660
msgid "Page of Pentacles"
msgstr "Sota de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:661
msgid "Study, ambition, focus, new project"
msgstr "estudio, ambición, foco, new project"

#: tarot_cards.lua:662
msgid "Slow start"
msgstr "Comienzo lento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:663
msgid ""
"Applied study. New skill. Constructive ambition. Start small, dream big."
msgstr ""
"Estudio aplicado. Nueva habilidad. Ambición constructiva. Empieza pequeño, "
"sueña grande."

#: tarot_cards.lua:664
msgid ""
"Lack of focus. Slow progress. Premature abandonment. Persist in studies and "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Falta de foco. Progreso lento. Abandono prematuro. Persiste en los estudios "
"y el trabajo."

#: tarot_cards.lua:668
msgid "Knight of Pentacles"
msgstr "Caballero de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:669
msgid "Hard work, routine, patience, reliability"
msgstr "Trabajo duro, rutina, paciencia, confiabilidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:670
msgid "Step by step"
msgstr "Paso a paso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:671
msgid ""
"Hard work. Reliable routine. Patience to build. Steady steps take you far."
msgstr ""
"Trabajo duro. Rutina confiable. Paciencia para construir. Los pasos firmes "
"te llevan lejos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:672
msgid ""
"Stagnation. Boredom. Lack of ambition. Move before inertia becomes permanent."
msgstr ""
"estancamiento. Aburrimiento. Falta de ambición. Muévete antes de que la "
"inercia se vuelva permanente."

#: tarot_cards.lua:676
msgid "Queen of Pentacles"
msgstr "Reina de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:677
msgid "Prosperity, practical care, home, security"
msgstr "prosperidad, cuidado práctico, hogar, seguridad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:678
msgid "Domestic cycle"
msgstr "Ciclo doméstico"

#: tarot_cards.lua:679
msgid ""
"Homely prosperity. Practical care. Generous mother. Your material security "
"sustains those you love."
msgstr ""
"Prosperidad hogareña. Cuidado práctico. Madre generosa. Tu seguridad "
"material sostiene a quienes amas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:680
msgid ""
"Neglect of home. Selfish materialism. Work-home imbalance. Take care of your "
"nest first."
msgstr ""
"Descuido del hogar. Materialismo egoísta. Desequilibrio entre trabajo y "
"hogar. Cuida primero tu nido."

#: tarot_cards.lua:684
msgid "King of Pentacles"
msgstr "Rey de Oros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:685
msgid "Success, abundance, stability, business"
msgstr "éxito, abundancia, estabilidad, negocios"

#: tarot_cards.lua:686
msgid "Financial maturity"
msgstr "Madurez financiera"

#: tarot_cards.lua:687
msgid ""
"Financial success. Prosperous leadership. Abundance with stability. Your "
"business acumen is a gift."
msgstr ""
"Éxito financiero. Liderazgo próspero. Abundancia con estabilidad. Tu "
"perspicacia para los negocios es un don."

#: tarot_cards.lua:688
msgid ""
"Miserliness. Extreme materialism. Corruption. Wealth without purpose is "
"empty and corrupts."
msgstr ""
"Tacañería. Materialismo extremo. Corruption. La riqueza sin propósito es "
"vacía y corrompe."

#: tarot_cards.lua:707
msgid "The Rider"
msgstr "El Jinete"

#: tarot_cards.lua:709
msgid "News, message, visitor, swiftness"
msgstr "noticias, mensaje, visitante, rapidez"

#: tarot_cards.lua:710
msgid ""
"News arriving. A visitor or important message. Swift movement and good "
"tidings on the horizon."
msgstr ""
"Noticias que llegan. Un visitante o mensaje importante. Movimiento rápido y "
"buenas noticias en el horizonte."

#: tarot_cards.lua:714
msgid "The Clover"
msgstr "El Trébol"

#: tarot_cards.lua:716
msgid "Luck, opportunity, lightness, moment"
msgstr "suerte, oportunidad, ligereza, momento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:717
msgid ""
"Passing luck. Fleeting opportunity. Simple joy. Enjoy the present moment "
"with lightness."
msgstr ""
"Suerte pasajera. Oportunidad fugaz. Alegría simple. Disfruta el momento "
"presente con ligereza."

#: tarot_cards.lua:721
msgid "The Ship"
msgstr "El Barco"

#: tarot_cards.lua:723
msgid "Travel, change, adventure, movement"
msgstr "viaje, cambio, aventura, movimiento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:724
msgid ""
"Travel. Change of scenery. New horizons. Venture forth, the world awaits you."
msgstr ""
"viaje. Cambio de escenario. Nuevos horizontes. Aventúrate, el mundo te "
"espera."

#: tarot_cards.lua:728
msgid "The House"
msgstr "La Casa"

#: tarot_cards.lua:730
msgid "Home, family, security, roots"
msgstr "hogar, familia, seguridad, raíces"

#: tarot_cards.lua:731
msgid ""
"Home. Family security. Firm roots. Care for your sacred space with love and "
"dedication."
msgstr ""
"hogar. Seguridad familiar. Raíces firmes. Cuida tu espacio sagrado con amor "
"y dedicación."

#: tarot_cards.lua:735
msgid "The Tree"
msgstr "El Árbol"

#: tarot_cards.lua:737
msgid "Health, growth, nature, vitality"
msgstr "salud, crecimiento, naturaleza, vitalidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:738
msgid ""
"Health. Personal growth. Connection with nature. Your roots are deep, your "
"fruits will come."
msgstr ""
"salud. Crecimiento personal. Conexión con la naturaleza. Tus raíces son "
"profundas, tus frutos llegarán."

#: tarot_cards.lua:742
msgid "The Clouds"
msgstr "Las Nubes"

#: tarot_cards.lua:744
msgid "Confusion, uncertainty, doubt, fog"
msgstr "Confusion, incertidumbre, duda, niebla"

#: tarot_cards.lua:745
msgid ""
"Confusion. Temporary uncertainty. Lingering doubts. Clarity will come after "
"the storm passes."
msgstr ""
"Confusion. Incertidumbre temporal. Dudas persistentes. La claridad llegará "
"después de que pase la tormenta."

#: tarot_cards.lua:749
msgid "The Snake"
msgstr "La Serpiente"

#: tarot_cards.lua:751
msgid "Seduction, betrayal, manipulation, cunning"
msgstr "seducción, traición, manipulación, astucia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:752
msgid ""
"Seduction. Betrayal or manipulation. Beware of false promises. Wisdom lies "
"in seeing beyond appearances."
msgstr ""
"seducción. Traición o manipulación. Cuidado con falsas promesas. La "
"sabiduría está en ver más allá de las apariencias."

#: tarot_cards.lua:756
msgid "The Coffin"
msgstr "El Ataúd"

#: tarot_cards.lua:758
msgid "Ending, transformation, loss, rebirth"
msgstr "final, transformación, pérdida, renacimiento"

#: tarot_cards.lua:759
msgid ""
"End of a cycle. Deep transformation. Let the past rest. The new is born from "
"what has gone."
msgstr ""
"Fin de un ciclo. Transformación profunda. Deja descansar el pasado. Lo nuevo "
"nace de lo que se ha ido."

#: tarot_cards.lua:763
msgid "The Bouquet"
msgstr "El Ramo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:765
msgid "Gift, compliment, beauty, gratitude"
msgstr "Regalo, compliment, belleza, gratitud"

#: tarot_cards.lua:766
msgid ""
"Gift. Compliment. Recognition. The beauty of life reveals itself in small "
"kindnesses."
msgstr ""
"Regalo. Elogio. Reconocimiento. La belleza de la vida se revela en pequeñas "
"bondades."

#: tarot_cards.lua:770
msgid "The Scythe"
msgstr "La Guadaña"

#: tarot_cards.lua:772
msgid "Cut, decision, rupture, warning"
msgstr "corte, decisión, ruptura, advertencia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:773
msgid ""
"Necessary cut. Drastic decision. Imminent rupture. Sometimes you must cut to "
"heal."
msgstr ""
"Corte necesario. Decisión drástica. Ruptura inminente. A veces hay que "
"cortar para sanar."

#: tarot_cards.lua:777
msgid "The Whip"
msgstr "El Látigo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:779
msgid "Conflict, debate, passion, repetition"
msgstr "conflicto, debate, pasión, repetition"

#: tarot_cards.lua:780
msgid ""
"Conflict. Heated discussions. Intense passion. Channel energy into "
"productive actions."
msgstr ""
"conflicto. Discusiones acaloradas. Pasión intensa. Canaliza la energía en "
"acciones productivas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:784
msgid "The Birds"
msgstr "Los Pájaros"

#: tarot_cards.lua:786
msgid "Talk, gossip, communication, nervousness"
msgstr "conversación, chisme, comunicación, nerviosismo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:787
msgid ""
"Important conversations. Gossip or news. Communication in focus. Choose your "
"words wisely."
msgstr ""
"Conversaciones importantes. Chismes or noticias. Comunicación en foco. Elige "
"tus palabras con sabiduría."

#: tarot_cards.lua:791
msgid "The Child"
msgstr "El Niño"

#: tarot_cards.lua:793
msgid "Innocence, new start, purity, playfulness"
msgstr "inocencia, new start, pureza, juego"

#: tarot_cards.lua:794
msgid ""
"Innocence. New beginning. Purity of intention. Embrace your inner child with "
"tenderness."
msgstr ""
"inocencia. Nuevo comienzo. Pureza de intención. Abraza a tu niño interior "
"con ternura."

#: tarot_cards.lua:798
msgid "The Fox"
msgstr "El Zorro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:800
msgid "Cunning, cleverness, deceit, adaptation"
msgstr "astucia, inteligencia, engaño, adaptación"

#: tarot_cards.lua:801
msgid ""
"Cunning. Cleverness. Beware of deception. Use your intelligence for good, "
"not manipulation."
msgstr ""
"astucia. inteligencia. Cuidado con el engaño. Usa tu inteligencia para el "
"bien, no para manipular."

#: tarot_cards.lua:805
msgid "The Bear"
msgstr "El Oso"

#: tarot_cards.lua:807
msgid "Strength, protection, power, authority"
msgstr "Strength, protección, poder, autoridad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:808
msgid ""
"Protective strength. Financial power. Natural authority. Leadership with "
"generosity brings prosperity."
msgstr ""
"Fuerza protectora. Poder financiero. Autoridad natural. El liderazgo con "
"generosidad trae prosperidad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:814
msgid "Hope, clarity, purpose, light"
msgstr "esperanza, claridad, propósito, luz"

#: tarot_cards.lua:815
msgid ""
"Hope. Clarity of purpose. Follow your inner light. The universe conspires in "
"your favor."
msgstr ""
"esperanza. Claridad de propósito. Sigue tu luz interior. El universo "
"conspira a tu favor."

#: tarot_cards.lua:819
msgid "The Stork"
msgstr "La Cigüeña"

#: tarot_cards.lua:821
msgid "Positive change, renewal, transition, blessing"
msgstr "Cambio positivo, renovación, transición, bendición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:822
msgid ""
"Positive change. Renewal. Blessed transition. New energies arrive to "
"transform your life."
msgstr ""
"Cambio positivo. renovación. Transición bendecida. Nuevas energías llegan "
"para transformar tu vida."

#: tarot_cards.lua:826
msgid "The Dog"
msgstr "El Perro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:828
msgid "Friendship, loyalty, companionship, trust"
msgstr "amistad, lealtad, compañía, confianza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:829
msgid ""
"Loyal friendship. Fidelity. Sincere companionship. Value those who walk "
"beside you."
msgstr ""
"Amistad leal. Fidelidad. Compañía sincera. Valora a quienes caminan a tu "
"lado."

#: tarot_cards.lua:835
msgid "Authority, structure, isolation, institution"
msgstr "autoridad, estructura, aislamiento, institución"

#: tarot_cards.lua:836
msgid ""
"Institutional authority. Protection. Solid structure. Build firm foundations "
"for the future."
msgstr ""
"Autoridad institucional. protección. Estructura sólida. Construye bases "
"firmes para el futuro."

#: tarot_cards.lua:840
msgid "The Garden"
msgstr "El Jardín"

#: tarot_cards.lua:842
msgid "Social life, community, meeting, public"
msgstr "Vida social, comunidad, encuentro, público"

#: tarot_cards.lua:843
msgid ""
"Social life. Community. Public encounters. Open yourself to new connections "
"and environments."
msgstr ""
"Vida social. comunidad. Encuentros públicos. Ábrete a nuevas conexiones y "
"ambientes."

#: tarot_cards.lua:847
msgid "The Mountain"
msgstr "La Montaña"

#: tarot_cards.lua:849
msgid "Obstacle, challenge, blockage, persistence"
msgstr "obstáculo, desafío, bloqueo, persistencia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:850
msgid ""
"Obstacle. Challenge to overcome. Temporary blockage. The view from the top "
"justifies the climb."
msgstr ""
"obstáculo. Desafío a superar. Bloqueo temporal. La vista desde la cima "
"justifica la subida."

#: tarot_cards.lua:854
msgid "The Crossroads"
msgstr "Los Caminos"

#: tarot_cards.lua:856
msgid "Choice, decision, direction, alternative"
msgstr "elección, decisión, dirección, alternativa"

#: tarot_cards.lua:857
msgid ""
"Important choice. Crucial decision. Multiple paths. Follow your intuition at "
"the crossroads."
msgstr ""
"Elección importante. Decisión crucial. Múltiples caminos. Sigue tu intuición "
"en la encrucijada."

#: tarot_cards.lua:861
msgid "The Mice"
msgstr "Los Ratones"

#: tarot_cards.lua:863
msgid "Loss, wear, worry, corrosion"
msgstr "pérdida, desgaste, preocupación, corrosión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:864
msgid ""
"Gradual loss. Wear and tear. Corroding worries. Attention to details that go "
"unnoticed."
msgstr ""
"Pérdida gradual. Desgaste. Preocupaciones corrosivas. Atención a los "
"detalles que pasan desapercibidos."

#: tarot_cards.lua:868
msgid "The Heart"
msgstr "El Corazón"

#: tarot_cards.lua:870
msgid "Love, passion, affection, romance"
msgstr "amor, pasión, afecto, romance"

#: tarot_cards.lua:871
msgid ""
"True love. Passion. Deep affection. Open your heart without fear of being "
"happy."
msgstr ""
"Amor verdadero. pasión. Afecto profundo. Abre tu corazón sin miedo a ser "
"feliz."

#: tarot_cards.lua:875
msgid "The Ring"
msgstr "El Anillo"

#: tarot_cards.lua:877
msgid "Commitment, alliance, cycle, union"
msgstr "compromiso, alianza, cycle, unión"

#: tarot_cards.lua:878
msgid ""
"Commitment. Alliance. Completed cycle. Honor your pacts and promises with "
"integrity."
msgstr ""
"compromiso. alianza. Ciclo completado. Honra tus pactos y promesas con "
"integridad."

#: tarot_cards.lua:882
msgid "The Book"
msgstr "El Libro"

#: tarot_cards.lua:884
msgid "Secret, knowledge, study, mystery"
msgstr "secreto, conocimiento, estudio, misterio"

#: tarot_cards.lua:885
msgid ""
"Secret. Hidden knowledge. Mystery to be revealed. The answer lies between "
"the lines."
msgstr ""
"secreto. Conocimiento oculto. Misterio por revelar. La respuesta está entre "
"líneas."

#: tarot_cards.lua:889
msgid "The Letter"
msgstr "La Carta"

#: tarot_cards.lua:891
msgid "Message, document, communication, news"
msgstr "mensaje, documento, comunicación, noticias"

#: tarot_cards.lua:892
msgid ""
"Written message. Important document. Formal communication. News arriving on "
"paper."
msgstr ""
"Mensaje escrito. Documento importante. Comunicación formal. Noticias que "
"llegan on paper."

#: tarot_cards.lua:896
msgid "The Gentleman"
msgstr "El Caballero"

#: tarot_cards.lua:898
msgid "Man, partner, action, yang"
msgstr "hombre, pareja, acción, yang"

#: tarot_cards.lua:899
msgid ""
"Influential male figure. Partner or seeker. Yang force. Action and "
"initiative."
msgstr ""
"Figura masculina influyente. Pareja o consultante. Fuerza yang. Acción e "
"iniciativa."

#: tarot_cards.lua:903
msgid "The Lady"
msgstr "La Dama"

#: tarot_cards.lua:905
msgid "Woman, partner, intuition, yin"
msgstr "mujer, pareja, intuición, yin"

#: tarot_cards.lua:906
msgid ""
"Influential female figure. Partner or seeker. Yin force. Intuition and "
"nurturing."
msgstr ""
"Figura femenina influyente. Pareja o consultante. Fuerza yin. Intuición y "
"cuidado."

#: tarot_cards.lua:910
msgid "The Lilies"
msgstr "Los Lirios"

#: tarot_cards.lua:912
msgid "Peace, harmony, wisdom, virtue"
msgstr "paz, armonía, sabiduría, virtud"

#: tarot_cards.lua:913
msgid ""
"Peace. Harmony. Mature wisdom. The virtue of patience blooms in your garden."
msgstr ""
"paz. armonía. Sabiduría madura. La virtud de la paciencia florece en tu "
"jardín."

#: tarot_cards.lua:919
msgid "Success, victory, energy, happiness"
msgstr "éxito, victoria, energía, happiness"

#: tarot_cards.lua:920
msgid ""
"Success. Victory. Full vital energy. Everything is illuminated, enjoy this "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"éxito. victoria. Energía vital plena. Todo está iluminado, disfruta este "
"momento."

#: tarot_cards.lua:926
msgid "Recognition, fame, creativity, intuition"
msgstr "Reconocimiento, fame, creatividad, intuición"

#: tarot_cards.lua:927
msgid ""
"Intuition. Recognition. Fame and creativity. Your talents are recognized "
"under moonlight."
msgstr ""
"intuición. Reconocimiento. Fama y creatividad. Tus talentos son reconocidos "
"bajo la luz de la luna."

#: tarot_cards.lua:931
msgid "The Key"
msgstr "La Llave"

#: tarot_cards.lua:933
msgid "Solution, opening, opportunity, answer"
msgstr "solución, apertura, oportunidad, answer"

#: tarot_cards.lua:934
msgid ""
"Solution. Opening doors. Decisive opportunity. The answer you seek is within "
"reach."
msgstr ""
"solución. Puertas que se abren. Oportunidad decisiva. La respuesta que "
"buscas está al alcance."

#: tarot_cards.lua:938
msgid "The Fish"
msgstr "Los Peces"

#: tarot_cards.lua:940
msgid "Abundance, finances, flow, prosperity"
msgstr "abundancia, finanzas, flujo, prosperidad"

#: tarot_cards.lua:941
msgid ""
"Financial abundance. Prosperity. Flow of resources. Wealth flows like clean "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Abundancia financiera. prosperidad. Flujo de recursos. La riqueza fluye como "
"agua limpia."

#: tarot_cards.lua:945
msgid "The Anchor"
msgstr "El Ancla"

#: tarot_cards.lua:947
msgid "Stability, security, work, steadfastness"
msgstr "estabilidad, seguridad, trabajo, firmeza"

#: tarot_cards.lua:948
msgid ""
"Stability. Lasting security. Steady work. Build solid foundations for "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"estabilidad. Seguridad duradera. Trabajo constante. Construye bases sólidas "
"para mañana."

#: tarot_cards.lua:952
msgid "The Cross"
msgstr "La Cruz"

#: tarot_cards.lua:954
msgid "Destiny, trial, burden, transcendence"
msgstr "destino, prueba, carga, trascendencia"

#: tarot_cards.lua:955
msgid ""
"Destiny. Necessary trial. Sacred burden. Suffering brings wisdom and "
"transcendence."
msgstr ""
"destino. Prueba necesaria. Carga sagrada. El sufrimiento trae sabiduría y "
"trascendencia."
